WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.639
The egg flew through the air.

2
00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:09.214
"Whoops!" Sid said.

3
00:00:09.215 --> 00:00:11.161
Rex leaped.

4
00:00:11.162 --> 00:00:13.691
He held out his arms.

5
00:00:13.692 --> 00:00:18.703
He caught the egg!

6
00:00:18.704 --> 00:00:24.430
"Whew!" Sara and Tor said.

7
00:00:24.431 --> 00:00:32.793
Now Sara led the way.

8
00:00:32.794 --> 00:00:35.573
Tor played with the egg.

9
00:00:35.574 --> 00:00:42.682
"Be careful, Tor," Sara said.

10
00:00:42.683 --> 00:00:52.571
The buddies went deep into the woods.

11
00:00:52.572 --> 00:01:00.215
Sara stopped.

12
00:01:00.216 --> 00:01:03.664
"I see lots of footprints.

13
00:01:03.665 --> 00:01:06.744
Which way should we go?"

14
00:01:06.745 --> 00:01:14.766
Tor scratched her head.

15
00:01:14.767 --> 00:01:19.222
Rex saw some bugs.

16
00:01:19.223 --> 00:01:22.200
"Cool!" he said.

17
00:01:22.201 --> 00:01:26.112
Rex followed the bugs.

18
00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:32.066
Sid followed Rex.

19
00:01:32.067 --> 00:01:35.852
"Where are those bugs going?"

20
00:01:35.853 --> 00:01:45.153
"Let's find out," Rex said.

21
00:01:45.154 --> 00:01:48.280
"Oh!" Tor said.

22
00:01:48.281 --> 00:01:52.132
"I remember where I found the egg!"

23
00:01:52.133 --> 00:01:55.523
"Great!" Sara said.

24
00:01:55.524 --> 00:02:03.423
"But . . . " She looked around.

25
00:02:03.424 --> 00:02:06.780
"Where are Rex and Sid?"

26
00:02:06.781 --> 00:02:10.757
Just then a dark shadow appeared.

27
00:02:10.758 --> 00:02:20.190
Sara and Tor looked up. Gulp!

